      <activity id="efb2d2e1-a519-5de8-b526-54a2fd224235" activityNameId="b5a3b392-49ff-5d5a-8183-5f1cdd395fbc" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Storage building, chemicals, solid</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Storage building, chemicals, solid
The infrastructure module includes 2 building halls of 15 m height with a floor area of  3000 m2 each, totalling to a storage capacitiy of about 30000 m3. The life time of the tanks was assumed to be 50 years. This infrastructure module has a high uncertainty and should only be seen as an approximation of the infrastructure for regional storage of solid chemicals.;
UUID: dcb21e72-a911-399e-9a84-891824b13dc8
Process for building hall includes construction and disposal porcesses, no contamination assumed for disposal, land use included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Data origins from the storage of sodium chloride, there is high uncertainty in the technological correlation. This may also affect the materials and types of building used.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Estimation from literature and from pictures and maps of 1 site for sodium chloride storage 
Extrapolations: No 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_dcb21e72-a911-399e-9a84-891824b13dc8.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
